# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST .gitignore — denies everything by default.
#
# Nothing enters this repo unless a rule below explicitly re-includes it.
# A denylist ("ignore these secrets") fails open: one unanticipated filename
# walks straight through. This fails closed instead.
#
# To add a new file type, add a `!` rule. Always run `git status` and read it
# before committing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Deny everything.
*

# Re-include directories so git can descend into them.
!*/

# --- Source ---
!*.py
!*.html
!*.css
!*.js

# --- Docs ---
!*.md

# --- Config ---
!*.json
!.env.example

# --- Project files ---
!.gitignore
!requirements.txt
!*.bat
!LICENSE

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Carve-outs: real data that must NEVER be committed, even though the
# extension rules above would otherwise allow it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Real client book and settings. Only the *.example.json versions ship.
config/clients.json
config/settings.json
data/loss_run_carriers.json

# Any backup, anywhere.
*.bak
*.backup
*.orig
*~

# Runtime state, scans, and generated output.
data/state.json*
data/latest_*.json
data/scan_*.json
data/completions.json
data/stage_responses.json
data/prev_work_items.json
data/logs/
data/outputs/
outputs/
uploads/
binders/
workbook/

# Source documents of any kind.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.csv
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.msg
*.eml

# Narrow exception: the synthetic market-update decks behind the RSM picker.
# These are generated single-slide fixtures with no data in them (see
# config/ and the catalog at data/rsm_market_db.json) and they are what makes
# the deck-assembly path runnable from a clean clone. This re-include is
# deliberately scoped to that one directory — every other .pptx stays denied.
!data/rsm_market_slides/*.pptx

# Secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
token*.json
credentials*.json

# Python.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Editors / OS.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Working file for the public-release prep. Not for publication.
SANITIZATION.md

# Carrier claims contacts. The .example.md version is the committed synthetic one.
docs/Skills/emailmap.md

# Screenshots of the running app, used in the README and docs. Narrowly scoped:
# .png stays denied everywhere else.
!docs/screenshots/*.png
